2. `governedPathsIn` — gitignore-style last-match-wins evaluation: iterate patterns in order, track last matching; positive → governed, negative → excluded. No match → not governed.
3. Fail-closed maintained — unchanged behavior since governance-change blocker just uses governedPathsIn output.
4. Apply to this repo: add two lines to the end of `merge.governed_paths` in `.github/atomaton/config.yaml` and `self/atomaton/config.yaml`:
