The issue is explicit: only `governedPathsIn` becomes last-match-wins. `merge.gates` is out of scope. But `readPatterns` in merge-gates.ts calls `pathPatternProblem`, which per the acceptance criteria must accept `!.github/atomaton/skills/**`. So `merge.gates` would accept `!x` as valid and silently match nothing — a regression of exactly the class #551 is about.

